{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["當烏西雅、約坦、亞哈斯、希西家作猶大王的時候，亞摩斯的兒子以賽亞得默示，論到猶大和耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝責備以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"天哪，要聽！地啊，側耳而聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我養育兒女，將他們養大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們竟悖逆我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛認識主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驢認識主人的槽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列卻不認識；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的民卻不留意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"嗐！犯罪的國民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擔着罪孽的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行惡的種類，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敗壞的兒女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們離棄耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與他生疏，往後退步。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你們為甚麼屢次悖逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還要受責打嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們已經滿頭疼痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全心發昏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從腳掌到頭頂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有一處完全的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盡是傷口、青腫，與新打的傷痕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都沒有收口，沒有纏裹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有用膏滋潤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你們的地土已經荒涼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的城邑被火焚毀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的田地在你們眼前為外邦人所侵吞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"既被外邦人傾覆就成為荒涼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"僅存錫安城","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像葡萄園的草棚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瓜田的茅屋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被圍困的城邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是萬軍之耶和華給我們稍留餘種，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們早已像所多瑪、蛾摩拉的樣子了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們這所多瑪的官長啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽耶和華的話！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這蛾摩拉的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要側耳聽我們上帝的訓誨！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們所獻的許多祭物與我何益呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公綿羊的燔祭和肥畜的脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已經夠了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公牛的血，羊羔的血，公山羊的血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都不喜悅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"你們來朝見我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰向你們討這些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們踐踏我的院宇呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要再獻虛浮的供物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"香品是我所憎惡的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"月朔和安息日，並宣召的大會，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也是我所憎惡的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作罪孽，又守嚴肅會，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不能容忍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的月朔和節期，我心裏恨惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都以為麻煩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我擔當，便不耐煩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們舉手禱告，我必遮眼不看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你們多多地祈禱，我也不聽。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的手都滿了殺人的血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要洗濯、自潔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從我眼前除掉你們的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要止住作惡，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"學習行善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋求公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解救受欺壓的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給孤兒伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為寡婦辨屈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們來，我們彼此辯論。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪雖像硃紅，必變成雪白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖紅如丹顏，必白如羊毛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們若甘心聽從，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必吃地上的美物，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不聽從，反倒悖逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必被刀劍吞滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親口說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["罪大惡極的城"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"可歎，忠信的城變為妓女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前充滿了公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義居在其中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現今卻有兇手居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的銀子變為渣滓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的酒用水攙對。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的官長居心悖逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與盜賊作伴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各都喜愛賄賂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追求贓私。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不為孤兒伸冤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寡婦的案件也不得呈到他們面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"因此，主－萬軍之耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的大能者說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哎！我要向我的對頭雪恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我的敵人報仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必反手加在你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"煉盡你的渣滓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除淨你的雜質。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必復還你的審判官，像起初一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"復還你的謀士，像起先一般。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然後，你必稱為公義之城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忠信之邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"錫安必因公平得蒙救贖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中歸正的人必因公義得蒙救贖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但悖逆的和犯罪的必一同敗亡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"離棄耶和華的必致消滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那等人必因你們所喜愛的橡樹抱愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必因所選擇的園子蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，你們必如葉子枯乾的橡樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像無水澆灌的園子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有權勢的必如麻瓤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的工作好像火星，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要一同焚毀，無人撲滅。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/SNG/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}